[{"type":"message","user":"U029GQMEQ2Y","text":"\u003c@U029GQMEQ2Y\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1627392219.283300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"f82cbd6e-551b-424a-b5d8-9a83a542839f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もしもRubyのときだけだったらmatchparenプラグインあたりがsyntaxみてるせいってのがあります。\n\n僕が遭遇したことあるのは、rubyでインデントの空白が多いファイルで。syntax offとかで解消するならたぶん該当します。","ts":"1627386331.282300","thread_ts":"1627374920.274200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gFkSr"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"46f6e002-cc96-4c02-bf82-2560c27fc745","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"Vim/Neovimのカーソル移動の速度がある時期からすごく遅くなったと感じるとき、皆さんどうしていますか？多分プラグインが原因なのかなあとは思うのですが、一つ一つ無効化していくのも面倒で…\n\n`:syntime on` というので調べてみたのですが、あまり参考になりませんでした…","ts":"1627374920.274200","thread_ts":"1627374920.274200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aEoZI"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"ca7d0b85-2aad-45b9-983d-6420bde07315","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"denopsやリモートプラグインにも無力ですね","ts":"1627380538.281900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3fkn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"133caba6-93ef-45be-89e0-3f1646e04774","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"_あと、Lua のプラグインにはこの手法は無力です。_","ts":"1627376780.281000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"pien","count":3,"users":["U01NKCTP7B4","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zv=Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b2423c6-65e5-40c5-9337-bddd317f0875","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"_ちなみに、profile.txt は一番下らへんを見るとわかりやすいです。_","ts":"1627376588.280400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AIoKj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d481c12e-2a96-4deb-a925-75714804d19f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/okuramasafumi/dotfiles/commit/4ccc5b0998da005c34dc55ab6344cb0196e686d8#diff-5731287ad25f34690667425fe83d880039c41ebb696aa63300460e7c41eacb83\u003e\n最近増えたのはこれかな(ただし1年前","ts":"1627375348.279900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N8g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e80d061-1e39-413a-843c-79b832588e1c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"もしそれが、 `ft=jsx or ft=tsx`だけで起きるならこれかもしれないですね\n\u003chttps://github.com/peitalin/vim-jsx-typescript\u003e","ts":"1627375344.279600","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"peitalin/vim-jsx-typescript","id":1,"title":"peitalin/vim-jsx-typescript","text":"React JSX syntax highlighting for vim and Typescript","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"257","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3JTA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52103266-6195-4b06-9cb4-4d56ef488d94","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/okuramasafumi/dotfiles/tree/master/vim\u003e","ts":"1627375243.278500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I3YNe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d17f6ac5-2d59-4c30-9bbe-3348f8305e98","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"こういうことをやって、重いプラグインを調べています。","ts":"1627375228.278200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LvZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ada6f276-50ef-482d-9788-2bb3d31daac5","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"1. vim を立ち上げ直す\n2. `:Profile` を実行する\n3. 気になっている操作を実行する\n4. vim を落とす\n5. profile.txt の中身を確認","ts":"1627375218.277900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ju7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a15ecee-fff3-4936-ade0-68d6397d7dd0","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"もしあるならdotfileのリポジトリあるとうれしいですね。","ts":"1627375191.277400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xFsvS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c3ce96b-1ba6-4072-aa20-3fd717c7bfb4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分は\n```command! -nargs=* Profile call s:command_profile('\u0026lt;args\u0026gt;')\nfunction! s:command_profile(section) abort\n  profile start ~/profile.txt\n  profile func *\n  execute printf('profile file %s', empty(a:section) ? '*' : a:section)\nendfunction```\nこのコマンドを定義していて","ts":"1627375158.275800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":4,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX","U01NKCTP7B4","U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zxb+J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c823180f-ec60-44fc-aad4-c715621c4905","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"syntaxとかかな?","ts":"1627375136.275200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nA1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b74c79f-089c-4ff4-b60f-deebdfff88ac","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"とりあえずここで「なんかカーソル移動のスピード落ちたんですけど」って質問投げますね（）\n最近追加したプラグインの一覧とか挙げれば、「あ、これ重いですよ」とか反応してくれる可能性がある","ts":"1627375133.275000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1627375159.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R1n5b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46f6e002-cc96-4c02-bf82-2560c27fc745","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"Vim/Neovimのカーソル移動の速度がある時期からすごく遅くなったと感じるとき、皆さんどうしていますか？多分プラグインが原因なのかなあとは思うのですが、一つ一つ無効化していくのも面倒で…\n\n`:syntime on` というので調べてみたのですが、あまり参考になりませんでした…","ts":"1627374920.274200","thread_ts":"1627374920.274200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aEoZI"}]}]
